# RxGuard Environment Variables
# Supports OpenRouter, Anthropic Claude, or Google Gemini:

# 1. OpenRouter (Recommended for Claude Sonnet 5.5 / 5 / Haiku via OpenRouter)
# Get your key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys (starts with sk-or-)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...

# 2. Direct Anthropic (Optional if using console.anthropic.com directly)
# Get your key at: https://console.anthropic.com (starts with sk-ant-)
# Note: Even if you paste an OpenRouter key (sk-or-) here, RxGuard automatically detects it!
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# 3. Google Gemini (Optional free tier fallback)
# Get your key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey (starts with AIza)
GEMINI_API_KEY=
